### Code Snippets

```
Example
Using
this
with a class attribute (x):
public class Main {
  int x;

  // Constructor with a parameter
  public Main(int x) {
    this.x = x;
  }

  // Call the constructor
  public static void main(String[] args) {
    Main myObj = new Main(5);
    System.out.println("Value of x = " + myObj.x);
  }
}
